 <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 12:45:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(migration): remove remaining Firestore runtime
 dependencies

- Remove Firestore reads/writes from proxy middleware, routing pageview data through local endpoints into Supabase.
- Update lib/auth/admin.ts to authorize via Supabase users table utilizing server-side client, dropping client-side Firestore reads.
- Update services/auth.service.ts to provision and retrieve profiles through a secure server API route (/api/auth/profile), severing Firestore ties while avoiding RLS complications.
- Refactor identity-firebase to enforce profile/login writes onto Supabase.
- Remove all remaining type coupling with firebase/firestore (Timestamp -> Date) across application models.
- Note: Firebase Authentication remains in-use for identity verification per project requirements.
